silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_02_free_category_monad_sections_04_mittens_in_the_monad_concrete_anchors#the_shape_of_the_mittens_cocone__objects__type__evidence__ta silm:hasLongDescription "The The shape of the Mittens cocone. Objects: type, evidence, taxonomy, quality, measurement, microchip, process. Arrows include any compatibility-condition arrows between legs (e.g., the taxonomy leg and the type leg both target into D_Mittens but at distinct source vertices).  is The shape of the Mittens cocone. Objects: type, evidence, taxonomy, quality, measurement, microchip, process. Arrows include any compatibility-condition arrows between legs (e.g., the taxonomy leg and the type leg both target into D_Mittens but at distinct source vertices)." .
