silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_02_free_category_monad_sections_04_mittens_in_the_monad_concrete_anchors#u___mittens__>_vetcareplan22_is_the_unique_morphism_that_fac silm:hasLongDescription "The u : Mittens -> VetCarePlan22 is the unique morphism that factors the care-plan cocone through Mittens. Its uniqueness says: the care plan derives FROM Mittens, and no other cat could play the role.  is u : Mittens -> VetCarePlan22 is the unique morphism that factors the care-plan cocone through Mittens. Its uniqueness says: the care plan derives FROM Mittens, and no other cat could play the role. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'u (unique mediator)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_02_free_category_monad_sections_04_mittens_in_the_monad_concrete_anchors#tg_is_the_underlying_graph_of_freeg;_it_has_no_composition__ a owl:NamedIndividual ;
